#: ../developer/code-structure.md:63
msgid ""
"`app.py` mounts the four listeners (the owner and admin API, the MCP-only"
" listener, the GitHub relay and the model relay) and installs the shared "
"response and exception policies. On the API and MCP listeners, "
"`api/_parameters.py` refuses with a 422, before any route runs, what "
"Postgres cannot store: NUL or an integer beyond `bigint` in a path or "
"query parameter, and NUL or a lone surrogate in a JSON body an owner or "
"administrator sends. Host and sandbox reports replace those characters "
"instead. `bootstrap/lifespan.py` builds the resources and starts and "
"stops background work; route modules own no startup or shutdown."
msgstr ""
"`app.py` 挂载四个监听器（所有者和管理员 API、仅 MCP 监听器、GitHub 中继和模型中继），并安装共享的响应和异常策略。在 "
"API 和 MCP 监听器上，`api/_parameters.py` 会在任何路由运行之前，以 422 拒绝 Postgres "
"无法存储的内容：路径或查询参数中的 NUL 或超出 `bigint` 的整数，以及所有者或管理员发送的 JSON 请求体中的 NUL "
"或孤立代理项。主机和沙箱的上报则改为替换这些字符。`bootstrap/lifespan.py` "
"构建资源，并启动和停止后台任务；路由模块不负责启动或关闭。"

