"`storage_attestation` commands that deployment runs inside a runner) and "
"the modules several packages share, such as `claimed_job.py`, "
"`control_plane_client.py`, `drivers.py`, `resident_transport.py` and "
"`session_lifecycle.py`."
msgstr ""
"顶层保留进程入口（`runner.py`、`sandbox_manager.py`、`candidate_check.py`，以及部署在 "
"runner 里运行的 `host_capacity` 和 `storage_attestation` 命令），以及多个包共用的模块，例如 "
"`claimed_job.py`、`control_plane_client.py`、`drivers.py`、`resident_transport.py`"
" 和 `session_lifecycle.py`。"

#: ../developer/code-structure.md:155
msgid ""
"`runner.py` is the command line. The host service "
"(`service/host_service.py`) enrolls the host, heartbeats, claims turns up"
" to its limit and drains on SIGTERM; `service/host_capabilities.py` holds"
" what it advertises and the proof each claim carries. Each claimed turn "
"runs in a child process, `turn/turn_child.py`, under the lease that "
"`service/attempt_lease.py` renews:"
msgstr ""
"`runner.py` "
"是命令行入口。主机服务（`service/host_service.py`）负责注册主机、发送心跳、在上限内认领轮次，并在收到 SIGTERM "
"时排空；`service/host_capabilities.py` 记录主机对外声明的能力以及每次认领携带的证明。每个认领到的轮次都在子进程 "
"`turn/turn_child.py` 中运行，受 `service/attempt_lease.py` 续期的租约约束："

#: ../developer/code-structure.md:161
msgid "`turn/group_reservation.py` checks and reserves the turn's sandbox group;"
msgstr "`turn/group_reservation.py` 检查并预留该轮次的沙箱组；"

#: ../developer/code-structure.md:162
msgid "`turn/shared_live_attempt.py` runs the attempt as a sequence of stages;"
msgstr "`turn/shared_live_attempt.py` 把 attempt 作为一系列阶段来运行；"

#: ../developer/code-structure.md:163
msgid "`turn/turn_stream.py` relays the admitted turn;"
msgstr "`turn/turn_stream.py` 中继已准入的轮次；"

#: ../developer/code-structure.md:164
msgid ""
"`turn/source_preparation.py` does the trusted Git work on the chat's "
"source, outside the sandbox."
msgstr "`turn/source_preparation.py` 在沙箱之外，对对话的源代码做可信的 Git 操作。"

#: ../developer/code-structure.md:167
msgid ""
"`claimed_job.py` defines claim payloads and lease errors. "
"`control_plane_client.py` owns attempt-scoped worker HTTP calls, "
"deadlines and event replay; it queues a turn's events on the ordered "
"sender in `event_sender.py`, which uploads them in batches."
msgstr ""
"`claimed_job.py` 定义认领载荷和租约错误。`control_plane_client.py` 负责 attempt 范围的 "
"worker HTTP 调用、超时和事件重放；它把一轮的事件放进 `event_sender.py` 中的有序发送器，由后者分批上传。"

#: ../developer/code-structure.md:172
msgid "Containers and the group lifecycle"
msgstr "容器与沙箱组生命周期"

#: ../developer/code-structure.md:174
msgid ""
"`container/chat_sandbox_models.py` holds retained-container specs, "
"inspection and status values, ownership labels and identity bounds."
msgstr "`container/chat_sandbox_models.py` 存放保留容器的规格、检查和状态值、归属标签以及身份边界。"

#: ../developer/code-structure.md:176
msgid ""
"`container/chat_sandbox.py` manages retained groups and their members. "
"Its `ChatSandboxManager` is assembled from one mixin per concern: "
"container creation (`chat_sandbox_create.py`), member execs and processes"
" (`chat_sandbox_members.py`), workspace and home files "
"(`chat_sandbox_workspace.py`), the guest observer "
"(`chat_sandbox_observation.py`) and archive markers "
"(`chat_sandbox_markers.py`). Terminals and the retained backend are in "
"`chat_sandbox_terminal.py` and `retained_backend.py`. A test pins the "
"manager's method set."
msgstr ""
"`container/chat_sandbox.py` 管理保留沙箱组及其成员。它的 `ChatSandboxManager` 由每个关注点一个的"
" mixin 组装而成：创建容器（`chat_sandbox_create.py`）、成员的 exec "
"和进程（`chat_sandbox_members.py`）、工作区和 home "
"文件（`chat_sandbox_workspace.py`）、guest "
"观察器（`chat_sandbox_observation.py`）以及归档标记（`chat_sandbox_markers.py`）。终端和保留后端在"
" `chat_sandbox_terminal.py` 和 `retained_backend.py` 中。有测试固定了这个管理器的方法集合。"

#: ../developer/code-structure.md:185
msgid ""
"`network/chat_sandbox_network.py` owns group bridges, relay membership, "
"Kata guest routes, and network proof and release, through a narrow "
"container protocol. Exact container identity, bounded exec and fail-stop "
"operations stay with the manager. The in-guest network check is "
"`network/guest_network_check.py`."
msgstr ""
"`network/chat_sandbox_network.py` 通过一个窄的容器协议，负责沙箱组网桥、中继成员关系、Kata guest "
"路由，以及网络证明和释放。精确的容器身份、有界的 exec 和失败即停的操作仍由管理器负责。guest 内的网络检查在 "
"`network/guest_network_check.py`。"

#: ../developer/code-structure.md:190
msgid ""
"`container/sandbox.py` owns the container and process boundary. "
"`observe/sandbox_inventory.py` is the retained-container inventory the "
"capacity report reads."
msgstr ""
"`container/sandbox.py` 负责容器与进程的边界。`observe/sandbox_inventory.py` "
"是容量报告读取的保留容器清单。"

#: ../developer/code-structure.md:194
msgid ""
"Stop, orphan recovery and archive deletion reserve the group's lifecycle "
"before any Docker or marker I/O, then check the group, member, container "
"and lifecycle identities again before accepting the result. The "
"supervisor's metadata lock protects in-memory ownership only."
msgstr ""
"停止、孤儿恢复和归档删除会在任何 Docker 或标记 I/O "
"之前预留沙箱组的生命周期，然后在接受结果之前再次核对沙箱组、成员、容器和生命周期的身份。supervisor 的元数据锁只保护内存中的归属。"

#: ../developer/code-structure.md:199
msgid ""
"A group's lifecycle is one value, `GroupLifecycleState` "
"(`supervisor/group_lifecycle_state.py`): which start, stop, exclusive "
"workspace operation and lifecycle check hold it, the barriers still owed "
"(a final archive, an orphan finalization), and the run's fence label. "
"Only that module's transitions change it, and a test refuses any other "
"assignment. `supervisor/group_lifecycle.py` is the admission table that "
"decides what may run now. The [design](../agents/specs/2026-11-05-group-"
"lifecycle-state.zh-CN.md) lists the reachable combinations and the "
"invariants the tests check."
msgstr ""
"沙箱组的生命周期是一个值 "
"`GroupLifecycleState`（`supervisor/group_lifecycle_state.py`）：哪个启动、停止、独占工作区操作和生命周期检查持有它，还欠着哪些屏障（最终归档、孤儿收尾），以及本次运行的栅栏标签。只有这个模块的状态转换能修改它，有测试禁止任何其他赋值。`supervisor/group_lifecycle.py`"
" 是准入表，决定当下什么可以运行。[设计文档](../agents/specs/2026-11-05-group-lifecycle-state"
".zh-CN.md)列出了可达的组合以及测试检查的不变量。"

