"steps"
msgstr "每种 CLI 的常驻会话类、打开它的驱动，以及它的启动步骤"

#: ../developer/code-structure.md:225
msgid ""
"`drivers.py` holds the generic Driver, Session and Turn contract and the "
"base classes the sessions share. `resident_transport.py` opens member "
"processes and journals native Forks without branching on the CLI: each "
"CLI's `member` module defines its launch steps (member config or private "
"home, trusted helpers, plugin installer, where platform instructions go, "
"and Claude's commit attribution), and the factory calls them. Only native"
" Fork still branches on the CLI. `member_setup/member_homes.py` holds the"
" private provider homes of Codex, OpenCode and Kilo members."
msgstr ""
"`drivers.py` 存放通用的 Driver、Session 和 Turn "
"契约，以及各会话共用的基类。`resident_transport.py` 启动成员进程并记录原生 Fork，不按 CLI 分支：每个 CLI 的"
" `member` 模块定义自己的启动步骤（成员配置或私有 home、可信辅助程序、插件安装器、平台指令放在哪里，以及 Claude "
"的提交署名），由工厂调用。只有原生 Fork 仍按 CLI 分支。`member_setup/member_homes.py` 存放 "
"Codex、OpenCode 和 Kilo 成员的私有服务商 home。"

#: ../developer/code-structure.md:234
msgid ""
"Callers import `cloud_agent_host.runtimes`, which exports the public "
"dialect API; sessions, `live` and the `member` modules build on "
"`drivers.py`, so import them by module name. Discovery facts (runtime "
"IDs, MCP support, reasoning efforts) live in "
"`cloud_agent_shared/runtime_catalog.py`, so the control plane advertises "
"them without loading host adapters. Version pins are in "
"`cloud_agent_shared/shared_protocol.py` and the image files."
msgstr ""
"调用方导入 `cloud_agent_host.runtimes`，它导出公开的方言 API；会话、`live` 和 `member` 模块建立在"
" `drivers.py` 之上，所以要按模块名导入。发现信息（运行时 ID、MCP 支持、推理强度）位于 "
"`cloud_agent_shared/runtime_catalog.py`，控制平面无需加载主机适配器就能对外声明它们。版本固定值在 "
"`cloud_agent_shared/shared_protocol.py` 和镜像文件中。"

#: ../developer/code-structure.md:241
msgid "Shared operation profiling"
msgstr "共用的操作性能剖析"

#: ../developer/code-structure.md:243
msgid ""
"Producers import `cloud_agent_shared.operation_profiling`, a facade over "
"`cloud_agent_shared/profiling/` ([its "
"guide](../../apps/backend/cloud_agent_shared/profiling/README.md)). Put "
"new profiling logic in the matching concern module, not in the facade. "
"Clock access goes through its replaceable `time` object, which keeps "
"tests deterministic and the default-off path intact."
msgstr ""
"生产方导入 `cloud_agent_shared.operation_profiling`，它是 "
"`cloud_agent_shared/profiling/` "
"的门面（见[它的说明](../../apps/backend/cloud_agent_shared/profiling/README.md)）。新的分析逻辑放进对应的关注点模块，不要放进门面。时钟访问通过可替换的"
" `time` 对象进行，这样测试保持确定性，默认关闭的路径也不受影响。"

#: ../developer/code-structure.md:249
msgid "Follow a browser action"
msgstr "跟着一次浏览器操作走"

#: ../developer/code-structure.md:251
msgid ""
"Next.js routes live under `apps/frontend/src/app/`. Shared feature UI is "
"under `components/features/` (`agents` for tasks and conversations, "
"`settings`, `teams`, `profile` and `auth`), reusable presentation "
"components under `components/`, and browser utilities and API clients "
"under `lib/`. Server-only integrations belong in the existing server "
"modules; a browser component must not pull server credentials into its "
"import graph."
msgstr ""
"Next.js 路由位于 `apps/frontend/src/app/`。共享的功能 UI 在 `components/features/` "
"下（`agents` 负责任务和对话，另有 `settings`、`teams`、`profile` 和 `auth`），可复用的展示组件在 "
"`components/` 下，浏览器工具和 API 客户端在 `lib/` "
"下。仅服务端的集成放在现有的服务端模块里；浏览器组件不得把服务端凭据拉进自己的导入图。"

#: ../developer/code-structure.md:258
msgid ""
"`lib/api/agents.ts` is the public API facade over the modules in "
"`lib/api/agents/`: jobs, threads, sessions, goals, configuration, "
"integrations, resource and usage reads, workspace files, terminals and "
"event streams. Keep endpoint paths, retries, credentials, cursors and "
"notifications with the operation that owns them."
msgstr ""
"`lib/api/agents.ts` 是公开的 API 门面，背后是 `lib/api/agents/` "
"中的模块：任务、对话线程、会话、目标、配置、集成、资源和用量读取、工作区文件、终端和事件流。端点路径、重试、凭据、游标和通知都跟着拥有它们的操作走。"

